At Site B, "coastal-rated warranty binding" — even if width fixed, no vendor has demonstrated cert. So two blockers.
At Site B, measured 700: physically none fit. The 900 explicit not admissible is subsumed.

Could note the 1200 assumption "superseded" per measurement. Use measurement date 2026-11-03; received 2026-11-05.

