- Status: For decision — conditional; not an expenditure approval.
- Repository commit at preparation? We can note base commit 272a4c7 plus uncommitted inbox item. After commit, package commit hash unknown at write time. Could update after commit? That would change hash. Maybe skip commit hash or use "base commit 272a4c7; package committed separately". Document control can say "Evidence cut-off: 2026-11-05T16:xx+08:00". Then after commit, no need to update.

